[0.306, "o", "pacrat sync — north against the store\r\n\r\nstore   /tmp/pacrat-demo/store\r\nhost    north  (pacrat plans for the machine it runs on)\r\nrepo    [dotfiles-aur] /tmp/pacrat-demo/repo  (missing pacman.conf + guard — `pacrat setup`)\r\n\r\ndrift on north (tracked vs installed)\r\n  native   1 missing · 0 extra   [pacman -Qqen]\r\n  aur      1 missing · 0 extra   [pacman -Qqem]\r\n  flatpak  in sync (0 packages)\r\n\r\nplan\r\n  install  2 missing packages:\r\n           demo-pkg, ripgrep\r\n\r\ncommands  nothing below has been run — `pacrat sync` only prints\r\n  sudo pacman -S --needed -- dotfiles-aur/demo-pkg ripgrep\r\n\r\nnote      [dotfiles-aur] is not in /etc/pacman.conf, so curated names cannot\r\n          resolve — `pacrat setup` prints the section to add.\r\n"]
